<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Things that we do,</l><l>Words that we say,</l><l>When in a spirit of love, how love</l><l>Prevails in this way.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The spirit in man,</l><l>Where our God lives;</l><l>Greatest of gifts we could e’er receive,</l><l>Freely He gives.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Powerful will,</l><l>Sober in mind;</l><l>Yet without love only threatening words</l><l>Other souls find.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
